<title>USA: AMEX CLOSING AVERAGES.</title>
<headline>AMEX CLOSING AVERAGES.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed lower in heavy trading.</p>
<p>The Amex Composite index fell 1.99 to 652.07.</p>
<p>The average price per share was down $0.05.</p>
<p>Decliners beat advancers 279 to 257.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 25,050,990 compared with 23,927,860 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1630 EDT/2030 GMT)</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1830))</p>
